## Hello! 💫

I'm a Caribbean developer focused on software development, web development, and digital experiences, with a strong interest in the intersection between design and technology.

I have experience in programming, web development, UI/UX design, and the creation of digital solutions. I specialize particularly in the visual side of software — how an application, website, or digital product looks, communicates, and interacts with its users.

I work with tools such as Figma and other software that brings design and development together, allowing me to explore both the visual and technical aspects of a project. My background in design helps me approach development not only from a functional perspective, but also through visual structure, usability, consistency, and overall experience.

This profile contains projects developed through my academic work, personal experimentation, learning, and commissioned projects. New software and development projects will continue to be documented here as I build and explore new ideas.

I'm interested in continuing to expand my knowledge across both development and design, experimenting with different technologies and finding better ways to turn ideas into functional digital experiences.

The goal is simple: keep building, keep learning, and move forward.
